      "message": "qa: Make PeerHasHeader more robust against nullptr\n\nNoticed while making changes to compact blocks code, right now\n`PeerHasHeader` relies on callers to never make the mistake of calling\nit with a nullptr, `state` can be trivially made into a reference, and\nwe can add an Assume for pindex being nullptr, and fall back to returning\nfalse.",
